 "text": "This video gets better the longer it runs. Watch.\n\nClaude Code just got Remotion's official skills, twelve of them. Every upgrade I name switches on the moment I say it.\n\nTransitions. Every cut used to be a hard cut. Now it moves.\n\nLight leaks, on every cut into a dark scene.\n\nHand-drawn highlights, and underlines.\n\nText that fits the frame, edge to edge.\n\nReal icons, with motion trails.\n\nAnimations, not static icons.\n\nCode that highlights itself as it types.\n\nAnd eight sounds became fifty, so nothing repeats.\n\nOne install did all of this. Comment REMOTION and I'll send you the command.",
